  "description" : "\"Jobroids\" are high-performance androids that support human life.\nThey support people`s daily lives with various jobs such as cleaning, construction, and moving.\nHowever, one day—the strongest enemy, \"Joker Braver,\" who once plotted world domination and was arrested by the Police Bravers, escapes from his base.\nWhopper, a police Jobroid, vows to arrest Joker once again and sets out.\nJoker appears before Whopper, who has specially combined with Police Braver at the crime scene.\nBut something is strange about him, and he refuses to say anything—\n\"Are you really... Joker?\"\nAmidst the deepening mystery, he powers up into Rising Police Braver by combining with a new ally, \"Deka Ride Armor White Bike,\" and confronts Joker!\nCan Whopper and his team protect the peace of the town and arrest Joker!?\nsource: weekly.ascii.jp\\googletranslate",
